architecture maintainers, as they're parts of the core IP.

Signed-off-by: Baoyou Xie <baoyou.xie-QSEj5FYQhm4dnm+yROfE0A@public.gmane.org>
---
 MAINTAINERS | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

