 F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/zte/
 F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/zx*
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/zte,zx2967-wdt.txt
 F:	include/dt-bindings/soc/zx*.h
 
